  "body_html": "<p>Show your love for the game with this cozy basketball blanket by Jeminise. Featuring a dynamic graphic illustration of a basketball player dunking near the hoop, this blanket can be personalized with your chosen name and number, making it a truly unique and thoughtful gift for players, coaches, and sports fans alike.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize this blanket with your own name and number for a personalized sports keepsake.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Crafted with two layers of polyester fabric available in cozy Fleece or ultra-soft Sherpa options.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from four convenient sizes to suit your needs: Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), or X-Large (80x60 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for keeping warm while lounging on the couch, reading on the sofa, camping, picnicking, or as decorative sports bedding.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; quick-drying microfiber fabric fluffier after washing.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Fleece/Sherpa</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Basketball Blanket 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Sports</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Basketball, Game</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>Name and Number (2 text inputs)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All Season</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
